## 🔧 技术规格

### 依赖关系

```
@deepseek-ai/cordis: ^4.0.1       # 核心框架
minimatch: ^10.2.6                 # 模式匹配
@dsh-enterprise/ui-settings: *     # 内部依赖
```

### 类型扩展

```typescript
// Cordis Context 扩展
interface Context {
  dataSecurityService: DataSecurityService
}

// Cordis Events 扩展
interface Events {
  'data-security/changed': (enabled: boolean) => void
  'data-security/check-file': (path: string) => CheckResult
}
```

### API 端点

```
GET  /api/settings/data-security
POST /api/settings/data-security
```

### 配置文件

```
$DSH_HOME/profiles/enterprise/.data-security.json
```

